    "title": "Who among former Merced Metro area high school stars will participate in events the week of Monday, Sept. 22? - Merced Times",
    "text": "These former Merced Metro area high school standouts are scheduled to compete the week starting Monday, Sept. 22.\nDawson Kerezsi\nCal Poly Mustangs\nFreshman\n6′4″ 280\nGranada High School\nHometown: Livermore\nNext Game: vs. Sacramento State Hornets, Saturday, Sept. 27, 6 p.m.\nJustin Incaprera\nBemidji State Beavers\nSenior\n5′11″ 195\nLos Banos High School\nHometown: Los Banos\nNext Game: vs. Minot State Beavers, Saturday, Sept. 27, 1 p.m.\nMichael Vander Woude\nDordt Defenders\nDefensive lineman\nSophomore\n6′3″ 247\nStone Ridge Christian High School\nHometown: Merced\nNext Game: vs. Northwestern Red Raiders, Saturday, Sept. 27, 1 p.m.\nOsriel Torres\nLa Verne Leopards\nFreshman\nGustine High School\nHometown: Gustine\nNext Game: vs. Chapman Panthers, Saturday, Sept. 27, 7 p.m.",
